<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47537" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρεμ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rest</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίνησις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				202a4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἠ. εἶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					988b4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Aristox.
				<u>Harm.</u>
				p.12
			</span></i> M., <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.46
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of the mind,
				<i>quietude</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠ. ψυχῆς περὶ τὰ δεινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Def.</u>
					412a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				406a27
			</span></i> (pl.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ πολλῆς ἠ.
			ὑμῶν</span> leaving you entirely <i>at rest</i>,
			v. l. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρημίας</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				13.8
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠρεμίη κοίτης</span> is perh. a
			mistake for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρημίη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				321.11
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
